    "title": "McLaren Flint hosts Flourishing in Flint event at Farmers' Market - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jesi Munguia ,\n1 days ago FLINT, Mich.—The McLaren Flint Family Medicine Residency Center is hosting a free community event at the Flint Farmers’ Market called ‘Flourishing in Flint.’. The event promotes Lifestyle Medicine, built on the six pillars designed to prevent and manage chronic diseases. The pillars include healthy eating, physical activity, restorative sleep, stress management, social connection, and avoidance of harmful substances. Read full article",
